<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's NLCF buys 37,500 tonnes of Chinese corn.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's NLCF buys 37,500 tonnes of Chinese corn.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's National Livestock Cooperatives Federation (NLCF) bought 37,500 tonnes of Chinese corn on Saturday at $141.90 a tonne C&amp;F , an official at the association said on Monday.</p>
<p>He said the purchase was made in three 12,500-tonne cargoes from Toepfer through private negotiation.</p>
<p>Arrival for the first cargo was set by April 25, the second by May 5 and the third by May 30 to the port of Kunsan.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
